OL,3,GNEWSAHopes hobby rooms will bring
OL,4,Aestate together
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour "hobby rooms" on a housing estate
OL,7,Fhave been renovated in the hope of
OL,8,Funiting its community.
OL,10,FThe Byker Wall Estate, in Newcastle,
OL,11,Fwas built between 1969 and 1982 and
OL,12,Fdesigned by architect Ralph Erskine,
OL,13,Fwho was worried about the lack of
OL,14,Fsocial space in such a high-density
OL,15,Fdevelopment.
OL,17,FAcross the estate there were about 80
OL,18,Frooms designed specially for people to
OL,19,Fsocialise in, but over the years many
OL,20,Ffell into disrepair and were sitting
OL,21,Fempty.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
